---
title: Kalita Wave 155 by Drop Coffee
source: https://www.dropcoffee.com/pages/this-is-how-we-brew-kalita-wave
filter: paper
---

@Kalita 16g 260g 92-96°C

/rinse
0:00 40-50g bloom
0:25 100g -- once it has degassed, between 0:20 and 0:30
1:00 150g
1:30 200g
2:00 260g -- never let the bed run dry, pour toward the center

target 3:00 -- 2:45 to 3:00
